Scott & Krista: Right.

00:16:11.000 --> 00:16:12.000
Scott & Krista: Right.

00:16:24.000 --> 00:16:39.000
Whitney Hodges: is that it does include, at the bottom of it, a photo gallery that people can scroll through, which is beautiful. I love the fact that that's included, but if people aren't, um, actually.

