Whitney Hodges: opening the email to get to see that right. It's kind of.

00:16:43.000 --> 00:17:09.000
Whitney Hodges: a moot point right now. Now, when we include photos in emails, sometimes that can increase the likelihood of your email ending up in a spam folder or in a promotions folder. So, for the time being, as long as you're okay with it, I would like to remove that photo gallery from that first email in its entirety, because I want to start to see people actually.

