Whitney Hodges: of what… what your process is, if anything, right, when a new lead comes in. Like, are you kind of trying them by phone? Are you popping in and sending them, you know, a personal text message to kind of follow up with this? Or are you just more kind of, like, at the point in terms of your bandwidth, like, kind of waiting to see who responds, and then…

