Whitney Hodges: a date in mind. Would you like for me to send you a link to our virtual tour? Are you available sometime this week for a quick call, or you know a Google meet, or you know a a facetime, whatever you want it to say.

00:22:42.000 --> 00:22:43.000
Scott & Krista: Yes.

00:22:49.000 --> 00:22:50.000
Scott & Krista: Exactly.

00:22:51.000 --> 00:22:52.000
Scott & Krista: Agreed.

00:22:52.000 --> 00:22:59.000
Whitney Hodges: But I do think that ending that first text message with some sort of question.

00:22:55.000 --> 00:22:58.000
Scott & Krista: A call for action.

