Scott & Krista: Absolutely.

00:23:05.000 --> 00:23:13.000
Whitney Hodges: you would want that to be. I mean, do you want to ask them if they're available for a call this week? Do you want to ask more about…

00:23:07.000 --> 00:23:08.000
Scott & Krista: Um, so…

00:23:12.000 --> 00:23:16.000
Scott & Krista: a call or a Google Meet, you know?

00:23:13.000 --> 00:23:15.000
Whitney Hodges: Guest counter date…

00:23:15.000 --> 00:23:17.000
Whitney Hodges: Mm-hmm. Okay.

00:23:16.000 --> 00:23:18.000
Scott & Krista: Um…

00:23:19.000 --> 00:23:39.000
Scott & Krista: I don't know, I'm kind of experimenting here. You know, I don't… on a certain level, maybe this is more art than science, and so maybe it's a, like… we try something, you look at the data, we see if it works. I agree with you that maybe pulling those photos out, if it does increase them going into spam, I mean…

00:23:27.000 --> 00:23:29.000
Whitney Hodges: Mm-hmm.

