Whitney Hodges: Mm-hmm.

00:23:54.000 --> 00:23:55.000
Scott & Krista: Um, so…

00:23:54.000 --> 00:23:56.000
Whitney Hodges: Mm-hmm.

00:23:55.000 --> 00:23:58.000
Scott & Krista: So I'm fine with that, and I think…

